orn baby Milly and mom are back home  while specialist Lindsay is getting  ready to be deployed to Kuwait but he's  looking on the bright side had that  flight actually been on time he would  have missed everything because he would  have been up in the air  Gail see there's a silver lining Thank  You Omar Villafranca don't we just love  his expressions while he's watching baby  milligan here and I love my baby Milly  yes and that we're all sort of in on it  too we're glad you're here the world  thanks again Omar that was great
 

